--- the prose a feature carries for its document ---
# Checkout

What a customer can do with a basket.

## Why these are read and not run

A scenario asserts that a behavior was implemented. Whether the code under it is right is nothing mechanical can judge.

## N-001 — A basket answers its total

| Step | Statement |
| --- | --- |
| Given | a basket holding two items |
| When | the total is asked for |
| Then | it answers the sum of the two |
